! Detailed ethylcyclohexane mechanism                                                                                                                            !
! Title:   The kinetic model of ethylcyclohexane combustion over a wide temperature range and its comprehensive validation                                       !
! Authors: Haonan Zhang1,2, Junjiang Guo3, Ping Xu4, Changhua Zhang*,4, Jingbo Wang*,1,2                                                                                   !
! Address: 1. College of Chemical Engineering, Sichuan University, Chengdu, 610065, P. R. China                                                                  !
!          2. Engineering Research Center of Combustion and Cooling for Aerospace Power, Ministry of Education, Sichuan University, Chengdu, 610065, P. R. China !
!          3. School of Chemical Engineering, Guizhou Institute of Technology, Guiyang 550003, PR China                                                          !
!          4. Institute of Atomic and Molecular Physics, Sichuan University, Chengdu 610065, P. R. China                                                         !
! Corresponding author: wangjingbo@scu.edu.cn, zhangchanghua@scu.edu.cn                                                                                          !
!****************************************************************************************************************************************************************!
!          
! The detailed mechanism for ethylcyclohexane combustion contains 1226 species and 5088 reactions. The core mechanism of H2/CO/C1-C2 combustion is AramcoMech 3.0.
! The high-temperature part of extended mechanism is generated through the ReaxGen program which have been developed by Li Xiangyuan research group. The 
! low-temperature part of extended mechanism refers to reaction types summarized by Zou et al., and those reactions about two-step oxygen addition and 
! subsequent reactions are replaced by the results calculated in present work.
!  
! core mechanism
! Version: AramcoMech 3.0
! Authors: C-W. Zhou, Y. Li, U. Burke, C. Banyon, K.P. Somers, S. Khan, J.W. Hargis, T. Sikes, E.L. Petersen, M. AlAbbad, A. Farooq, Y. Pan, Y. Zhang, Z. Huang, J. Lopez, Z. Loparo, S.S. Vasu, H.J. Curran
! Website: http://c3.nuigalway.ie/combustionchemistrycentre/mechanismdownloads/
!
! low-temperature part of extended mechanism 
! Title: Experimental and kinetic modeling investigation on ethylcyclohexane low-temperature oxidation in a jet-stirred reactor                       
! Authors: Jiabiao Zou, Xiaoyuan Zhang, Yuyang Li, Lili Ye, Lili Xing, Wei Li, Chuangchuang Cao, Yitong Zhai, Fei Qi, Jiuzhong Yang         
